<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said it has qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Boston, Mass., $90 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Laurel, Md., $13.255 million public improvement refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Auburn, N.Y., $4.350 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Harris County MUD #102, Texas, $1.475 million water and sewer revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
